stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Stopped
    Stopped --> Active: Arm valid batch
    state "Armed capture" as Active {
        [*] --> WaitingForLift
        WaitingForLift --> WaitingForFinger: Finger lifted
        WaitingForFinger --> Capturing: Finger placed
        Capturing --> Saving: Usable probe
        Capturing --> WaitingForLift: Capture rejected
        Saving --> WaitingForLift: Commit verified
    }
    Active --> Stopped: Stop or diagnostic
    Saving --> RecoveryReview: Storage uncertain
    RecoveryReview --> Stopped: Preserve for review